  "notModeled": [
    "analog input and reference ladder (VRT/VRB, self-bias VRTS/VRBS); the result is always the 0 V code 0x00",
    "pipeline latency of 2.5 clock cycles (the code is constant); sampling on CLK falling, output valid tOD after CLK rising",
    "timing values are typical only (no maximum given): tOD 19.5 ns (data rising), tEN 11 ns, tDIS 15 ns",
    "conversion rate limits (1-30 MHz typ, 20 MSPS specified)",
    "no power-down pin; stopping the clock reduces power",
    "pins 11 and 13 are both DVDD: the pin table makes pin 11 the output-driver supply (2.5 V to pin 13), the applications section calls pin 11 the core and pin 13 the drivers, and the operating ratings limit pin 13 - pin 11 to < 0.5 V; vcc is the union 2.5-5.25 V"
  ],
